        "like": 1
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've had it happen on rare occasion with the item tracking system I have. it's just really infrequent but happens when there's a lot of people around but when it does crash it crashes consistently for everyone at the same time. its a much bigger issue if you have large contacts. as if there's a lot of people around it can hit that point where it just dies for everyone. its really sucks when you accidently crash a lobby using something that you could be using all the time with no problem then everyone dies.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
