      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This can be caused easily by one popular Avatar Gimmick using Contacts, Motchiri Shader (https://booth.pm/ja/items/4108136).\n\nIf many (in one my friends case, 5) players with Mottiri Shader come in contact with each other, it causes a crash.\n\nMottiri Shader uses many contacts (more than 40 contacts) with one sender for each contact and used is by many Japanese users.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
