      "value": "@{5e877e5e60de627e6ba7946a|full_name}: Thanks, it works! I modified my debug avatar to have 200 contacts components, so none of them were removed by default. Then I tested the exact same scenario on live and beta. When the live version crashes, the beta works fine.\n\nHowever, I don't have any easy way to check if they all work correctly when there are many of them. We will try to check that on our group meeting using CuteDancer again, but it will be after the beta becomes stable version.",
